  ok   -- asking for 1 turn(s) of a transcript that replays EVERY id returns exactly 1, at read_fraction 0.483. An identity-keyed cut returns 4 for every one of these, because the newest ids' FIRST appearance is in the first half -- it reports head_complete=True while silently answering a different question
